{"id":"10.3.2","doc":"T","title":"Low-Power Clocks","words":258,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In general, ESP32-S3 powers down its external crystal "},{"t":"field","v":"XTAL_CLK"},{"t":"text","v":" and PLL to reduce power consumption when working in low-power modes."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"During this time, the chip's low-power clocks remain on to provide clocks to different power domains, such as the power management unit, RTC peripherals, RTC fast memory, RTC slow memory, and wireless circuits in the digital domain."}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-10_3-3.png","alt":"Figure 10.3-3. RTC Clocks","caption":"Figure 10.3-3. RTC Clocks (RTC Slow Clock and RTC Fast Clock)"},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-10_3-4.png","alt":"Figure 10.3-4. Wireless Clocks","caption":"Figure 10.3-4. Wireless Clocks"},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 10.3-1. Low-Power Clocks","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Clock Type"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Clock Source"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Selection Option"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Effective for"}]],"rows":[{"n":3,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"RTC Slow Clock"}],[{"t":"text","v":"XTAL32K_CLK"}],[{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_ANA_CLK_RTC_SEL"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Power management unit"}]]},{"n":4,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"RTC Slow Clock"}],[{"t":"text","v":"RC_FAST_DIV_CLK"}],[{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_ANA_CLK_RTC_SEL"}],[{"t":"text","v":"RTC Timers"}]]},{"n":5,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"RTC Slow Clock"}],[{"t":"text","v":"RC_SLOW_CLK (Default)"}],[{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_ANA_CLK_RTC_SEL"}],[{"t":"block","v":"ULP","id":"ulp"},{"t":"text","v":" Timers"}]]},{"n":6,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"RTC Fast Clock"}],[{"t":"field","v":"RC_FAST_CLK"},{"t":"text","v":" divided by n (Default)"}],[{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_FAST_CLK_RTC_SEL"}],[{"t":"text","v":"ULP co-processor"}]]},{"n":7,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"RTC Fast Clock"}],[{"t":"field","v":"RC_FAST_CLK"},{"t":"text","v":" divided by n (Default)"}],[{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_FAST_CLK_RTC_SEL"}],[{"t":"text","v